/// The `FA_PROVIDER_*` env preconfig: headless/Docker runs pass provider
/// configuration at container start as environment variables
/// (`FA_PROVIDER_TYPE`, `FA_PROVIDER_NAME`, plus `FA_PROVIDER_CONFIG` — or
